  "description": "In the heart of Hanyang lies Butterfly Dream, an establishment where powerful men can spend a pleasant night of respite and dream their problems away. Do-Kyeom Baek, a diligent and stoic lord, is one of those men. Like many before him, he has fallen madly in love with So-Rang, the most treasured performer at the Dream, known as “The Butterfly.” Try as he might to push his desires away, Do-Kyeom cannot stop himself from dreaming constantly of So-Rang… \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
